8. a-na _i7_ he-re-e-em qa-as-su isz-ku-un 
#tr.ts: ana nārim herêm qassu iškun 
#tr.en: to waterway dredging his hand set. 
9. a-lum ma-asz-ku-li-ia{ki} 
#tr.ts: ālum maškulliya 
#tr.en: The city Maškulliya 
10. e-le-nu-um bad3-i-pi2-iq-{d}iszkur{ki} 
#tr.ts: elēnum dūr-ipiq-addu 
#tr.en: above Dūr-ipiq-Addu 
11. i-na _a-sza3_ be2-ra-am sza-ki-in 
#tr.ts: ina eqlim bēram šakin 
#tr.en: at a distance of a double-hour set. 
12. ki-ma a-na ma-asz-ku-li-ia{ki} u2-qe2-ri-ba-am 
#tr.ts: kīma ana maškulliya uqerribam
#tr.en: As I Maškulliya approached, 
13. {disz}sa-mu-{d}iszkur isz-pu-ra-am-ma qa-du-um s,a-bi-im
#tr.ts: samu-addu išpuramma qadum ṣābim 
#tr.en: Samu-Addu wrote and with troops 
14. a-na a-lim at-ta-ha-ra-am a-na a-lim ak-szu-dam-ma 
#tr.ts: ana alim attaḫaram ana alim akšudamma 
#tr.en: to the city I hastened, in the city arrived, and  
