#tr.ts: ana ṣābim ša ittiya illikam 
#tr.en: to the troops who with me came,  
20. [t,e4]-ma#-am sza t,a3-ra-di-im 
#tr.ts: ṭēmam ša ṭarādim 
#tr.en: report of dispatch,  
